creature CoffeeShop
  traits
    beans is a number
    milk is a number
    coffees_made is a number
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait beans to 10
    give self the trait milk to 5
    give self the trait coffees_made to 0
  end born

  action brew_espresso
    when self beans > 0
      give self the trait beans to self beans - 1
      give self the trait coffees_made to self coffees_made + 1
      say "Brewed an Espresso. Beans left: " + self beans
    otherwise
      say "Cannot brew Espresso: Out of beans!"
    end when
  end action

  action brew_latte
    when self beans > 0
      when self milk > 0
        give self the trait beans to self beans - 1
        give self the trait milk to self milk - 1
        give self the trait coffees_made to self coffees_made + 1
        say "Brewed a Latte. Beans left: " + self beans + ", Milk left: " + self milk
      otherwise
        say "Cannot brew Latte: Out of milk!"
      end when
    otherwise
      say "Cannot brew Latte: Out of beans!"
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring CentralPerk to life as CoffeeShop

CentralPerk does brew_latte
CentralPerk does brew_espresso
CentralPerk does brew_latte
CentralPerk does brew_latte
CentralPerk does brew_latte
CentralPerk does brew_latte
CentralPerk does brew_latte
